{"id":287,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Slakoth’s heart beats just once a minute. Whatever happens, it is content to loaf around motionless. It is rare to see this Pokémon in motion."},{"games":["Omega Ruby"],"text":"Slakoth lolls around for over 20 hours every day. Because it moves so little, it does not need much food. This Pokémon’s sole daily meal consists of just three leaves."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"If it eats just three leaves in a day, it is satisfied. Other than that, it sleeps for 20 hours a day."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"The way Slakoth lolls around makes anyone who watches it feel like doing the same."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It spends nearly all its time in a day sprawled out. Just seeing it makes one drowsy."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It sleeps for 20 hours every day. Making drowsy those that see it is one of its abilities."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It sleeps virtually all day and night long. It doesn’t change its nest its entire life, but it sometimes travels great distances by swimming in rivers."},{"games":["Ruby"],"text":"SLAKOTH lolls around for over twenty hours every day. Because it moves so little, it does not need much food. This POKéMON’s sole daily meal consists of just three leaves."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Truant","hidden":false,"description":"Each time the Pokémon uses a move, it spends the next turn loafing around."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"forest","color":"Brown","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":287,"name":"Slakoth","condition":null,"children":[{"id":288,"name":"Vigoroth","condition":"Lv. 18","children":[{"id":289,"name":"Slaking","condition":"Lv. 36","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,10],[1,281],[6,227],[9,303],[14,29],[17,133],[22,343],[25,675],[30,68],[33,175],[38,583]],"machine":[332,